{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_durnar_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_durnar_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"杯中舊事","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_durnar_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"b3f3d96ea688b3fcb0c9d2d09eb9dba937f8119e286d2226ecbc798ddfda24ec","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"一天的訓練結束後，堅雷來到酒吧喝酒放鬆，她“意外”遇到了自己從前帶的新兵，於是和對方回憶起了過往。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"深夜\n羅德島本艦，“再來一杯”酒吧"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"達里奧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我在，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我能喝了嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是是，女士您已經說過很多次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"教育不聽話的小朋友，透過對抗挑戰您和預備幹員們的極限，與其他教官“友好”爭吵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我為您複述您的嘮叨嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"如您所願，女士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我就想喝口酒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"還有十分鐘，女士，酒精飲料只在九點之後提供，這是規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"遵守每個規矩會要你命的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"規矩讓我們的生活更有秩序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有任何不滿，您知道應該向誰提出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只是工作人員，我們遵從她訂下的守則。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"給我蘋果汁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"請稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"忙了一天喝口酒都不行，哪來那麼多事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"要是從前的您早就掀翻桌子把電刃架在對方脖子上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"噢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"漢克？！你怎麼跑這裡來了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直都在，瑪凱拉教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡就別用本名了，叫我堅雷吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"堅雷教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"把教官去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的堅持，教官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，您的飲料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，一個個都倔得跟軍用馱獸似的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您的稱讚，教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝您的讚美，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不是要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"算了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這位先生要喝什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"冰水，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"請稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......我的兵啊......我怎麼就帶出這種兵來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（灌了口蘋果汁）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"繼續吧，漢克......你現在做什麼來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"是，教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我一般都出外勤，負責黑鋼和羅德島間的往來對接事項。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"這次保護對方的合作人員來羅德島洽談相關事宜，結束後會護送他們返回黑鋼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"像是你會做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"來的時候有受傷嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"只有傷患，沒有減員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了您的教導，教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我那時候教的可都是些老東西了，你要現在還用那套辦法，就算穿軍方那批試驗單兵源石動力甲也救不了你哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"軍方已經為少數部隊列裝動力甲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"不是原型，而是量產型，主要分配給像您這樣的精英士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧，我可穿不下那個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"您可以的，大馬克都能穿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（大口喝乾杯中的蘋果汁）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你還是老樣子，聊幾句就能把話題帶到死胡同裡去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，教官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您的冰水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"說到大馬克，他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這傢伙給我寫信，找所有人一個個簽了名讓我到這裡來工作，結果最後都不來見我一面？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"他並不是羅德島的雇員，大馬克是沃爾沃特科欽斯基的項目測試主管，基本沒有時間離開哥倫比亞來見您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"沃爾沃特科欽斯基？那為什麼把我請到羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"這個我不太清楚，也許您之後可以親自去問問他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟他是您最引以為傲的學生之一，如果您親口提問，我想他會很樂意為您解惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼說嘛，我為你們每個人驕傲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"每一個人，漢克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"每一個人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，時間到了，請問您要喝點什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？能喝了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是的女士，九點了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"拿杯“砂中烈火”給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"然後給他一杯“黎博利的眼淚”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"教官，我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"別說了，我懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"請稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"教官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"來，給我說說吧，你們當初怎麼活下來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒記錯的話，我的抗議應該沒有改變結果吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的確被戰地指揮官當作敢死隊派上了前線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"萬幸的是，他的士兵不這麼認為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"士兵兄弟們把我們認作是——你的象徵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"好像有我們在，瑪凱拉·春雷士官長就依然在戰場上奮戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是個中士，怎麼就士官長了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......之後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"在周圍部隊的支援下，我們完成了預定作戰目標，短暫休整後，收到了下一個任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"攻佔敵方的指揮部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"那時敵方部隊已經組織不起像樣的抵抗了，所以在到達指揮部後，我們分成了兩隊人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"一隊在指揮部外掃蕩殘兵並進行支援，一隊進入指揮部內部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"對方引爆了指揮部和我們同歸於盡，進去的人都沒能回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"戰役結束後，軍隊上層好像對這次行動的部署產生了分歧，他們忙著派系傾軋，我們則從前線調到了後方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"那之後又過了一兩個月，我們就被集體退役了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"和您一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都很自責，也很迷茫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"從前覺得身為哥倫比亞公民，響應總統的號召，成為軍人，保衛家園，守護邊疆與信念，我們要做的應該是這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"但最後，只是目睹了軍官們的傲慢，軍隊生涯也結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"責罵隊友無濟於事，遷怒於您也解決不了問題，但那一個月裡的我們，除了訓練和日常出勤外，確實處在那樣的情緒輪迴中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"退役之後，大家回到哥倫比亞，回到生活中去，這種負面情緒才遠離我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我不懂戰略，但沒有您，這場戰爭可能不會那麼快就結束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"勝利終歸是哥倫比亞的，只是沒有您決定性的衝鋒迫使指揮官們，後續的拉鋸戰將會十分慘烈，更多的士兵將戰死沙場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼會安慰人卻不會聊天呢，漢克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"教官您別笑話我了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"別在意嘛，我只是隨口一說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你不是應該繼承家業去幹票大的嗎，怎麼跑羅德島來當幹員了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"報告教官——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"不要報告，正常說就行了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"是，教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我和大妹談過，最後決定讓她來繼承家業，我做副手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"之前我們聊天的時候......我記得你和大妹關係不好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"是的教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"但在退役後，我想了很多，也第一次跟大妹好好談了一晚上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"她從小就很精明，上學主修的也是商業課程，要是家裡想把產業做大，還是交給她更合適。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"等父親真的決定退休把家業交給大妹，我就辭掉羅德島的工作，回家裡幫忙承擔些工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"現在......算是在累積經驗吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"透過羅德島拓寬眼界，也累積些哥倫比亞內外的人脈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"這對我今後的生活非常重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直很好奇，你家裡到底是做什麼的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"資產管理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我的家族常年為梅蘭德兒童權益基金會提供財產管理業務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"梅蘭德......兒童權益基金會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"一個致力於改善哥倫比亞兒童生活品質的非政府組織。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是做慈善？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的話，我希望教官也能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這個聽上去也是很適合你的事情欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"回家以後一定要好好幹啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"不准給我丟人，明白了沒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"是，教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你們能過得好，我就很開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"以後又有東西和同事吹噓了，哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"女士、先生，你們的飲品到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（使用源石技藝點燃堅雷的酒）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"請慢用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"終於來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（一口飲盡）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——辣辣辣辣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好爽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"您都噴火了，教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"小事小事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你也喝吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"教官，您知道我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"喝下去，一等兵漢克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這是命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"是，教官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"（喝乾酒杯中的飲品）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"感覺怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"沒那麼辣，教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那是當然的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"因為這只是杯白葡萄汁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"白葡萄汁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"一看你就不常來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"“黎博利的眼淚”是他們調酒師的暗號，意思就是一杯白葡萄汁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你不會真以為，我忘記你重度酒精過敏了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"教官......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那天晚上背著你從陸軍基地跑到陸軍醫院差點把我累死，這樣的事情啊，還是不要發生第二次比較好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"達里奧！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"您還想喝點什麼嗎，女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"拿杯“冰焰”給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，漢克，再來杯眼淚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位請稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"您接受軍事法庭審判之後，到底去了哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這個......保密可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望您能告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"而且這件事，其他人也一定想知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"（拿出錄音裝置）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，有話好好說，錄音幹嘛呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"“我們”都想知道，教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"啊你小子，就是為了這個才跑來這裡和我喝酒的嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們十七個人一致的願望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我是我們中唯一一位羅德島雇員，所以由我來做這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這個......怎麼說都應該找個私密點的地方慢慢聊吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的環境，您比較好開口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是在訓練場或其他地方，您一定會以自己還有事要忙為名打岔，然後一個閃身溜走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我可沒把握能攔下您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"調查得還真清楚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"都是您教導得好，教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"行，行吧，那我就隨便說說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"話說在前頭，有些事我都忘了，你可別一個勁在那追問啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您，教官。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位的飲品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"請慢用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，酒來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"邊喝邊說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（喝了一小口“冰焰”）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"哈——那時候——應該是直接被驅逐出軍隊丟回老家了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"天天在家鄉小酒館裡喝到爛醉，然後跑大街上去發酒瘋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧家裡人還算理解，又是哄又是誇，總算回過一點神來，沒變成廢人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"後來靠著關係，被妹妹塞進了當地警署做特警。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你那是什麼表情，嗯？有個比姐姐有能力的妹妹不是很正常嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"她可比我成熟太多了，家裡大小事情都是她來協調的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說啊，我才應該是她妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（喝了一小口“冰焰”）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我們那治安還算不錯，所以我也沒什麼事做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"後來市政府的人搞什麼警員隊伍整頓，縮減了特警隊的規模，我就這樣被踢出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是太平日子不想花錢養人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"之後又在家裡待了段時間，天天吃家裡的，心裡過意不去，就拿了點積蓄出來，到臨近移動城市裡去找新工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"逛了幾周後，一家企業找我去幫他們管理安保員，我也沒想太多，就去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"結果去了之後才發現，那個所謂的安保團隊就是公司低價雇了幾個愣頭青看門，一沒訓練二沒裝備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"即使想幫他們做點什麼，一到要資金的時候，那些董事就開始說這說那，還讓我別管太多，不然對我不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這都叫什麼話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"真是，我*哥倫比亞粗口*。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（猛喝了一口“冰焰”）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"跟那幫子商人沒什麼好談的，*哥倫比亞粗口*！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"正好那時候城市裡有支拓荒補給隊要出發，還在招護衛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我乾脆帶了那個公司裡幾個願意跟我走的年輕人一起用自由傭兵身份接受了補給隊雇傭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我們第一次聯繫您親屬的時候——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"在拓荒區呢，送信過來都要幾個月找不到人也正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你之前去過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"有時間的話，我建議你去那裡體驗一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我之前也沒想到哥倫比亞會有那樣的地方啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"吃著最差的，用著最爛的，每個人卻都心懷希望，覺得自己今後能過上好日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"結果呢，盜匪、野獸、天災，只要荒野裡有的你都能碰上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"那日子，唉，可真是太刺激了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"鏽錘、獸群、幫派。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"還有*哥倫比亞粗口*童子軍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"新曼法斯特真是個*哥倫比亞粗口*鬼地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（喝乾了“冰焰”）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我帶過去的小夥最後都沒能回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我，一個被拓荒隊唾棄的老兵，灰溜溜地從荒野上逃回城市裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"回到家裡，老爹過世了，妹妹接過擔子操辦家務，而她的姐姐還是像幾年前那樣一事無成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"其實在收到信的時候我有想過，像我這樣的廢人，到底值不值得被這個組織接納。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"事實證明，我算是來對地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"也謝謝你，馬克·格林下士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我為你們驕傲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"（關上錄音裝置）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"想說的就這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"就到這吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"是，教官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"（收起錄音裝置）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的生活真的不錯，有一群可愛的小朋友能教，有一幫講義氣又可靠的好同事能聊，還有個腦袋瓜不錯的長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至還能碰到個小熟人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"不是指你啊，是個沃爾珀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"一個感染者小姑娘，沒來之前用電刃和她交流過，現在嘛，能面對面聊幾句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"真好啊，真好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的日子能持續多久呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"達里奧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我來了，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"今天有什麼特別點的即興特調，給我來一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，漢克？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢克","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"“黎博利的眼淚”，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，好，很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，達里奧，他的費用今天算我頭上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"再拿點零食過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我還要和我的學生多聊會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了，兩位請稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧小夥子，夜生活才剛剛開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不醉不歸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_260_durnar","aliases":["堅雷"]}]}
